    <string name="onb_start">Get started</string>
    <string name="onb_1_title">Welcome to Switch Recomp Helper</string>
    <string name="onb_1_body">This app extracts a dump of your own Switch cartridge into ExeFS and RomFS: the two parts you need for, for example, static recompilation.\n\nEverything happens on your phone; nothing is uploaded.</string>
    <string name="onb_2_title">What do you need?</string>
    <string name="onb_2_body">• An XCI dump of a cartridge you own.\n• Your own prod.keys, dumped from your own Switch (for example with Lockpick_RCM).\n\nThe app ships no keys or game files and does not share them.</string>
    <string name="onb_3_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="onb_3_body">1. Choose your prod.keys. You only do this once: the app remembers them.\n2. Choose the XCI file.\n3. Choose the folder for the result.\n4. Switch ExeFS and/or RomFS on and tap Extract.</string>
    <string name="onb_4_title">Result and tips</string>
    <string name="onb_4_body">The files go into a new folder named after your dump + _extracted, split per title into exefs and romfs.\n\n• Make sure you have enough free space: RomFS is often several GB.\n• Keep the app open while extracting; the screen stays on.\n• Tap the question mark at the top right to see this guide again.</string>
